The Job Portal Web Application is a web-based recruitment management system developed using Python and Flask. The main aim of this project is to provide a centralized platform where job seekers and employers can interact efficiently. In the traditional recruitment process, finding suitable jobs and candidates is time-consuming and difficult. This system simplifies the recruitment process by allowing employers to post job vacancies and job seekers to search and apply for jobs online.
The application supports multiple user roles such as job seekers, employers, and administrators. Employers can manage job postings and view applications submitted by candidates. Job seekers can register, search for jobs using filters, and apply online. The admin module helps in managing users and maintaining system security.
The project uses Flask as the backend framework, HTML/CSS/Bootstrap for frontend design, and SQLite/PostgreSQL as the database. The system provides secure authentication, responsive design, and centralized data management.
This project helps improve recruitment efficiency, reduces manual work, and provides a user-friendly platform for online hiring activities.
